          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"2d-ising-mcmc-glauber-dynamics\">2D Ising MCMC (Glauber Dynamics)</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook provides a ipython notebook template for the computer experiment described in <code>lec5.pdf</code>:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>lattice size <code>L=32</code>, coupling <code>J=1</code></li>\n<li>run <code>5000</code> sweeps at temperatures <code>T in {1.5, 2.3, 3.5}</code></li>\n<li>compare magnetization traces and autocorrelation</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Notation reminder: <code>beta = 1 / T</code>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "PKri",
      "code_hash": "f10ea3cf261d2a7931ed1d897fc75d43",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"demo-run-parameters\">Demo run parameters</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>random initialization</li>\n<li><code>L=32</code>, <code>J=1</code>, <code>h=0</code></li>\n<li><code>S=800</code> sweeps at <code>T=2.3</code> (<code>beta=1/2.3</code>)</li>\n<li>animate spin configuration after each sweep</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "BYtC",
      "code_hash": "d4aefa0c2a3356c8534f74c0cbbe5c1e",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"illustrative-experiment\">Illustrative Experiment</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Run <code>5000</code> sweeps for <code>T in {1.5, 2.3, 3.5}</code> and compare:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>magnetization traces <code>M_t</code></li>\n<li>autocorrelation of magnetization</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
